6a72h1"></script><script type="text/javascript" async="" src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id=GTM-KPFJGVB&amp;gtm=4e6a72h1"></script><script type="text/javascript" async="" src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id=GTM-TM2HMP5&amp;gtm=4e6a72h1"></script><script type="text/javascript" async="" src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id=GTM-KQ275X5&amp;gtm=4e6a72h1"></script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@type":"FAQPage","@context":"https://schema.org","mainEntity":[{"name":"How can I use my BMO Platinum Rewards Credit Card to earn more points?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"It’s easy! For every eligible dollar you charge to your BMO Platinum Rewards Credit Card, you automatically earn points. Charges that are eligible for points include, but are not limited to, airline, restaurant, hotel, car rental, service station, mail and online orders and retail purchases. Payments and cash advances are ineligible for points accrual. Learn more about how the BMO Flex Rewards Program works.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"Do my points ever expire?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"No, your BMO Flex Rewards points will not expire as long as your account is open and in Good Standing. Good Standing means that your account is not canceled, past due or otherwise in default under the terms of an Agreement you have with us. Find out more about the BMO Flex Rewards Program Rules.","@type":"Answer"}}]}</script><script>
