om: 24px;"><span class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><p>Get no-fee, no-impact access to your credit score.<span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:2,&quot;335551620&quot;:2,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p></span></div></div></div></article><article id="pers-30AROhWiaeAzJGdNSPvrYu-MobileAppBannerSlide2" data-slide="true" data-testid="slides" aria-label="Card 3 of 3" tabindex="-1" class="css-19mv406 ek76tno0" aria-hidden="false" style="visibility: visible; pointer-events: auto;"><div id="pers-30AROhWiaeAzJGdNSPvrYu-MobileAppBanner-cardbox-container-2" class="css-vatrow ek76tno2"><picture data-testid="picture"><source media="(min-width:1268px)" srcset="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/transform/a888dcfa-f010-473c-a251-d5333d7715ce/7e24218e-card-monitor-desktop?format=webp&amp;quality=100" type="image/webp"><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/transform/a888dcfa-f010-473c-a251-d5333d7715ce/7e24218e-card-monitor-desktop?format=webp&amp;quality=100" type="image/webp"><source media="(min-width:768px)" srcset="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/transform/a888dcfa-f010-473c-a251-d5333d7715ce/7e24218e-card-monitor-desktop?format=webp&amp;quality=100" type="image/webp"><source media="(max-width:767px)" srcset="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/transform/a888dcfa-f010-473c-a251-d5333d7715ce/7e24218e-card-monitor-desktop?format=webp&amp;quality=100" type="image/webp"><source media="(min-width:1268px)" srcset="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/transform/a888dcfa-f010-473c-a251-d5333d7715ce/7e24218e-card-monitor-desktop?format=png&amp;quality=100" type="image/png"><source media="(min-width:1024px)" srcset="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/transform/a888dcfa-f010-473c-a251-d5333d7715ce/7e24218e-card-monitor-desktop?format=png&amp;quality=100" type="image/png"><source media="(min-width:768px)" srcset="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/transform/a888dcfa-f010-473c-a251-d5333d7715ce/7e24218e-card-monitor-desktop?format=png&amp;quality=100" type="image/png"><source media="(max-width:767px)" srcset="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/transform/a888dcfa-f010-473c-a251-d5333d7715ce/7e24218e-card-monitor-desktop?format=png&amp;quality=100" type="image/png"><img loading="eager" class="primitive-image css-1rvhu3f e188sdvu0" src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/transform/a888dcfa-f010-473c-a251-d5333d7715ce/7e24218e-card-monitor-desktop?format=png&amp;quality=100" alt=""></picture><div id="pers-30AROhWiaeAzJGdNSPvrYu-MobileAppBanner-cardbox-content-2" class="css-18np1nn ek76tno3"><div class="css-1n2mv2k ek76tno4"></div><div data-height="cardBoxHeading" class="css-tebfj4 ek76tno5" style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><span class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><h3 class="css-0"><a aria-label="Learn more about the B M O credit card alerts digital app feature, opens in a new tab" data-meta="bmo credit card alerts--rte-mobileappbanner" data-ana="bmo credit card alerts--rte-mobileappbanner" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/main/personal/credit-cards/card-monitor/" target="_blank" data-rte="true">﻿BMO Credit Card Alerts</a></h3></span></div><div data-height="cardBoxContent" class="css-qn22wm ek76tno6" style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><span class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><p>Track spending, receive real-time updates, and manage your card with custom alerts and notifications — all in one place.</p></span></div></div></div></article></div></div></section></div></div></section><section id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G" data-region="accordion" tabindex="-1" class="css-gywdsc e1jqivam3"><div id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-module-padding-wrapper" class="css-18bgle7 e1jqivam0"><div class="css-172osot e8gy0t81"><div id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-accordion-outer-wrapper-container-row" class="css-pe2xa0 e8gy0t80"><div id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3GAccordiongNoImageWrapper" class="css-1xndu4e e8gy0t82"><div class="css-1ops03w e8gy0t83"><div id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3GHeading" class="css-8buaje e8gy0t85"><span class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><h2 class="css-0">BMO Platinum Rewards Credit Card <span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">FAQs</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">Frequently Asked Questions</span></span>​</h2></span></div></div><div id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3GContent" class="css-7fxpwp e8gy0t86"><ul role="list" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-accordion-wrapper" data-accordion-primitive="true" data-orientation="vertical" class="css-1naxy90"><li id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-1" role="listitem" data-accordion-item="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" class="css-x2zac1"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open"><button type="button" aria-controls="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-1Panel" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-1Button" data-ana="how do i activate my new card--accordionlistitem 1-accordion" class="css-1nbs5pr" data-radix-collection-item="" aria-expanded="true"><span>How do I activate my new card?<span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><img class="css-0" src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/asset/0265ec6a-7b5a-4e42-a595-deb92ef32a9c/chevron-down-24.svg" alt="" loading="eager" data-testid="icon" width="24" height="24"></button></h3><div data-state="open" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-1Panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-1Button" data-orientation="vertical" aria-hidden="false" class="css-1t417a1" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: 160px; --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); transition-duration: 0s; animation-name: none; --radix-collapsible-content-height: 160px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 792px;"><div class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><p>Once you've received your card, just give us a call to activate it.&nbsp;</p><p>If you have a <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Platinum Credit Card, a <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Platinum Rewards Credit Card, <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Boost Secured Credit Card or a <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Cash Back Credit Card, call <a aria-label="Call us at 1 8 5 5 8 2 5 9 2 3 7" data-meta="1-855-825-9237--rte-accordionlistitem 1-accordion" data-ana="1-855-825-9237--rte-accordionlistitem 1-accordion" href="Tel:1-855-825-9237" target="_self" data-rte="true">1-855-825-9237</a>.&nbsp;</p><p>If you have a <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Premium Rewards Credit Card or a <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Escape Credit Card call <a aria-label="Call us at 1 8 5 5 8 2 5 9 2 3 8" data-meta="1-855-825-9238--rte-accordionlistitem 1-accordion" data-ana="1-855-825-9238--rte-accordionlistitem 1-accordion" href="Tel:1-855-825-9238" target="_self" data-rte="true">1-855-825-9238</a>.</p></div></div></li><li id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-2" role="listitem" data-accordion-item="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="css-x2zac1"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-2Panel" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-2Button" data-ana="how can i use my bmo platinum rewards credit card to earn more--accordionlistitem 2-accordion" class="css-1nbs5pr" data-radix-collection-item="" aria-expanded="false"><span>How can I use my <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Platinum Rewards Credit Card to earn more points?<sup><span class="css-wvkc32 e19opmff0">&nbsp;footnote 1&nbsp;</span><span aria-hidden="true">1</span></sup><sup class="css-129gw94 eyqmael1">,</sup><sup><span class="css-wvkc32 e19opmff0">&nbsp;footnote 2&nbsp;</span><span aria-hidden="true">2</span></sup></span><img class="css-0" src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/asset/0265ec6a-7b5a-4e42-a595-deb92ef32a9c/chevron-down-24.svg" alt="" loading="eager" data-testid="icon" width="24" height="24"></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-2Panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-2Button" data-orientation="vertical" aria-hidden="true" class="css-1t417a1" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); transition-duration: 0s; animation-name: none; height: 0px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 792px;"><div class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><p>It’s easy! For every eligible dollar you charge to your <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Platinum Rewards Credit Card, you automatically earn points. Charges that are eligible for points include, but are not limited to, airline, restaurant, hotel, car rental, service station, mail and online orders and retail purchases. Payments and cash advances are ineligible for points accrual. Learn more about how the <a aria-label="Access the B M O Flex Rewards program rules (P D F, 260 K B), opens in a new tab" data-meta="bmo flex rewards program--rte-accordionlistitem 2-accordion" data-ana="bmo flex rewards program--rte-accordionlistitem 2-accordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/rewardsconsumerpoints.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">BMO Flex Rewards Program</a> works.</p></div></div></li><li id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-3" role="listitem" data-accordion-item="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="css-x2zac1"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-3Panel" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-3Button" data-ana="do my points ever expire--accordionlistitem 3-accordion" class="css-1nbs5pr" data-radix-collection-item="" aria-expanded="false"><span>Do my points ever expire?</span><img class="css-0" src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/asset/0265ec6a-7b5a-4e42-a595-deb92ef32a9c/chevron-down-24.svg" alt="" loading="eager" data-testid="icon" width="24" height="24"></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-3Panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-3Button" data-orientation="vertical" aria-hidden="true" class="css-1t417a1" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); transition-duration: 0s; animation-name: none; height: 0px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 792px;"><div class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><p><span>No, your </span><span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span><span> Flex Rewards points will not expire as long as your account is open and in Good Standing. Good Standing means that your account is not canceled, past due or otherwise in default under the terms of an Agreement you have with us. Find out more about the </span><a aria-label="Access the B M O Flex Rewards Program Rules (P D F, 257k b), opens in a new tab" data-meta="bmo flex rewards program rules--rte-accordionlistitem 3-accordion" data-ana="bmo flex rewards program rules--rte-accordionlistitem 3-accordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/rewardsconsumerpoints.pdf" target="_blank" data-rte="true">BMO Flex Rewards Program Rules</a><span>.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></li><li id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-4" role="listitem" data-accordion-item="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="css-x2zac1"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-4Panel" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-4Button" data-ana="how do balance transfers work5--accordionlistitem 4-accordion" class="css-1nbs5pr" data-radix-collection-item="" aria-expanded="false"><span>How do balance transfers work?<sup><span class="css-wvkc32 e19opmff0">&nbsp;footnote 5&nbsp;</span><span aria-hidden="true">5</span></sup></span><img class="css-0" src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/asset/0265ec6a-7b5a-4e42-a595-deb92ef32a9c/chevron-down-24.svg" alt="" loading="eager" data-testid="icon" width="24" height="24"></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-4Panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-4Button" data-orientation="vertical" aria-hidden="true" class="css-1t417a1" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); transition-duration: 0s; animation-name: none; height: 0px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 792px;"><div class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><p>Great question. You can transfer balances from other credit card accounts to your new BMO credit card account. Please note that you can’t transfer balances from other accounts you have with us. Balance Transfers accrue interest from the date of transaction without a grace period.</p></div></div></li><li id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-5" role="listitem" data-accordion-item="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="css-x2zac1"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-controls="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-5Panel" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-5Button" data-ana="how do i report a lost or stolen credit card--accordionlistitem 5-accordion" class="css-1nbs5pr" data-radix-collection-item="" aria-expanded="false"><span>How do I report a lost or stolen credit card?</span><img class="css-0" src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/asset/0265ec6a-7b5a-4e42-a595-deb92ef32a9c/chevron-down-24.svg" alt="" loading="eager" data-testid="icon" width="24" height="24"></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-5Panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="pers-28yWCFxHHzMhqTKNCkpU3G-item-5Button" data-orientation="vertical" aria-hidden="true" class="css-1t417a1" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); transition-duration: 0s; animation-name: none; height: 0px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 792px;"><div class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><p>Can’t find your card? No worries, we’ve got you covered.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>If you’ve misplaced your card or suspect that it’s been stolen, just let us know. Visit the <a aria-label="Access B M O Lost and stolen credit card page" data-meta="lost and stolen credit card page--rte-accordionlistitem 5-accordion" data-ana="lost and stolen credit card page--rte-accordionlistitem 5-accordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/main/personal/credit-cards/report-lost-stolen-card/" target="_self" data-rte="true">Lost and Stolen Credit Card Page</a> to learn more.&nbsp;</p></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-region="ctaCardGrid" id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRw" tabindex="-1" class="css-168dy5z e1jqivam3"><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRw-content-banner-grid-wrapper" class="css-n3frn1 e1jqivam2"><div class="css-18bgle7 e1jqivam0"><div class="css-1l3sl9s em9x5780"><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRw-ContentWrapper" class="css-tunpik em9x5781"><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwHeading" class="css-m54pc0 em9x5783"><span class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><h2 class="css-0">Have questions? That’s what we’re here for.</h2></span></div><ul id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRw-container" role="list" class="css-mb50q7 em9x5784"><li id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwWrapper0" role="listitem" class="css-1kcipsp em9x5785"><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCard0-container" class="css-1cxnwvl e6njce40"><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCard0-outer-card-container"><div class="css-12kdr5z e6njce42"><img src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/asset/1bb175a1-c466-4bac-8b8b-7849e9aa3958/branch-xs.svg" alt="" loading="eager" data-testid="ill"></div><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCard0-card-container" class="css-u3xqhs e6njce49"><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCard0-card-content" class="css-ak5gtg e6njce47"><div data-height="ctaCardHeader" class="css-118gb1o e6njce43" style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><span class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><h3 class="css-0">Let's meet</h3></span></div><div data-height="ctaCardContent" class="css-1vvp3km e6njce44" style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><span class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><p class="typography-body css-li7dim">Stop by your nearest financial center to chat about credit card options.</p></span></div></div><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCard0-cta-1" class="css-4kk486 e6njce48"><a id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCta10" href="https://usbranchlocator.bmo.com/" aria-label="Find a financial center, opens in a new tab" data-ana="find a financial center--ctacard 1-ctacardgrid" data-meta="find a financial center--ctacard 1-ctacardgrid" data-region="ctaCard 1-ctaCardGrid" target="_blank" class="css-1isvxqf"><span style="display:inline-flex"><img class="css-1dvx7dh" src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/asset/bf14bf15-30ce-46c0-a5d4-e5225d748a4c/location-24.svg" alt="" loading="eager" data-testid="icon"><span>Find a financial center</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></li><li id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwWrapper1" role="listitem" class="css-1kcipsp em9x5785"><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCard1-container" class="css-1cxnwvl e6njce40"><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCard1-outer-card-container"><div class="css-12kdr5z e6njce42"><img src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/asset/1ca7ae1e-4f46-4cb5-b4dc-b9fc28be4606/mobile-phone-xs.svg" alt="" loading="eager" data-testid="ill"></div><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCard1-card-container" class="css-u3xqhs e6njce49"><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCard1-card-content" class="css-ak5gtg e6njce47"><div data-height="ctaCardHeader" class="css-118gb1o e6njce43" style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><span class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><h3 class="css-0">Give us a call</h3></span></div><div data-height="ctaCardContent" class="css-1vvp3km e6njce44" style="margin-bottom: 0px;"><span class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><p>We’ll reach out by phone or email at a time that’s convenient for you.</p></span></div></div><div id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCard1-cta-1" class="css-4kk486 e6njce48"><a id="pers-4ga5pny1ZkYIGxkgwceHRwCta11" href="tel: 1-888-340-2265" aria-label="Call us at 1 8 8 8 3 4 0 2 2 6 5" data-ana="call 1-888-340-2265--ctacard 2-ctacardgrid" data-meta="call 1-888-340-2265--ctacard 2-ctacardgrid" data-region="ctaCard 2-ctaCardGrid" target="_self" class="css-ljr3e9"><span style="display:inline-flex"><img class="css-1dvx7dh" src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/asset/cc98ed79-0930-471c-8450-870621b7fe74/call-us-24.svg" alt="" loading="eager" data-testid="icon"><span>Call 1-888-340-2265</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section data-region="subFooterContextual" id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes" tabindex="-1" class="css-10n57y9 e1jqivam3"><div id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes-content-wrapper" class="css-n3frn1 e1jqivam2"><div class="css-r4cpdy e12ic6gu0"><div class="css-1nhpvdy el85ie10"><div id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes-footer-section-wrapper" class="css-nmv2j5 el85ie11"><div cols="1" rows="1" class="css-2ir9jv el85ie12"> <h2 id="subfooterHeader-pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes00" class="css-3b8n9k el85ie13">Get Started</h2></div><div cols="1" rows="2" class="css-wp3sqk el85ie12"><ul role="list" id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes0" class="css-8oz52a el85ie14"><li role="listitem" id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes0-Get-Started-listitem-0" class="css-l49r6b el85ie15"><a id="pers-uP6QB7h5jCtrh41f74yLMLink0Tab" href="https://usdigital.bmo.com/www/#/enrollment" aria-label="Enroll in B M O Digital Banking, opens in a new tab" data-ana="enroll in bmo digital banking--subfootercontextual" data-meta="enroll in bmo digital banking--subfootercontextual" data-region="subFooterContextual" target="_blank" class="css-c158vd"><span style="display:inline-flex"><span>Enroll in BMO Digital Banking</span></span></a>