ager" data-testid="ill" width="135" height="40"></picture><span class="css-16p2vqx el85ie18">Click to download on Google Play</span></a></li></ul><div cols="2" rows="1" class="css-hr3r3y el85ie12"> <h2 id="subfooterHeader-pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes11" class="css-3b8n9k el85ie13">Manage your payments and rewards</h2></div><div cols="2" rows="2" class="css-kpbeib el85ie12"><ul role="list" id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes1" class="css-8oz52a el85ie14"><li role="listitem" id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes1-Manage-your-payments-and-rewards-listitem-0" class="css-l49r6b el85ie15"><a id="pers-310SMxzWjG2hxoAmgQI1EILink0Tab" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/autopayform.pdf" aria-label="Set up automatic payments (P D F, 115 K B), opens in a new tab" data-ana="set up automatic payments pdf 115 kb--subfootercontextual" data-meta="set up automatic payments pdf 115 kb--subfootercontextual" data-region="subFooterContextual" target="_blank" class="css-c158vd"><span style="display:inline-flex"><span>Set up automatic payments (PDF, 115 KB)</span></span></a></li><li role="listitem" id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes1-Manage-your-payments-and-rewards-listitem-1" class="css-l49r6b el85ie15"><a id="pers-4RuWJH8Mqi2iUzLQyPej7yLink1Tab" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/main/personal/credit-cards/card-monitor/" aria-label="Learn more about B M O Credit Card Alerts" data-ana="bmo credit card alerts--subfootercontextual" data-meta="bmo credit card alerts--subfootercontextual" data-region="subFooterContextual" target="_self" class="css-c158vd"><span style="display:inline-flex"><span>BMO Credit Card Alerts</span></span></a></li><li role="listitem" id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes1-Manage-your-payments-and-rewards-listitem-2" class="css-l49r6b el85ie15"><a id="pers-1ZpQzWCpYD2b5wyZt661dXLink2Tab" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/main/personal/credit-cards/digital-wallet/" aria-label="Set up your digital wallet to make mobile payments" data-ana="set up your digital wallet--subfootercontextual" data-meta="set up your digital wallet--subfootercontextual" data-region="subFooterContextual" target="_self" class="css-c158vd"><span style="display:inline-flex"><span>Set up your digital wallet</span></span></a></li><li role="listitem" id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes1-Manage-your-payments-and-rewards-listitem-3" class="css-l49r6b el85ie15"><a id="pers-4DoSVCHbdOWdoKbrOZrZfXLink3Tab" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/main/personal/credit-cards/bmo-paysmart-installment-lending/" aria-label="Learn more about B M O Paysmart Installment Plans" data-ana="bmo paysmart installment plans--subfootercontextual" data-meta="bmo paysmart installment plans--subfootercontextual" data-region="subFooterContextual" target="_self" class="css-c158vd"><span style="display:inline-flex"><span>BMO PaySmart Installment Plans</span></span></a></li><li role="listitem" id="pers-11hoEfOjx9SHk08dTomIes1-Manage-your-payments-and-rewards-listitem-4" class="css-l49r6b el85ie15"><a id="pers-1C8fNbxxEHn7DZvsMpMF1ALink4Tab" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/rewardsconsumerpoints.pdf" aria-label="Access BMO Flex Rewards Program Rules (P D F, 261 K B), opens in a new tab" data-ana="bmo flex rewards program rules pdf 261 kb--subfootercontextual" data-meta="bmo flex rewards program rules pdf 261 kb--subfootercontextual" data-region="subFooterContextual" target="_blank" class="css-c158vd"><span style="display:inline-flex"><span>BMO Flex Rewards Program Rules (PDF, 261 KB)</span></span></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-region="legalAccordion" id="pers-5SJqm2i5hKu0pdrjaIuhxE" tabindex="-1" class="css-10n57y9 e1jqivam3"><div id="pers-5SJqm2i5hKu0pdrjaIuhxEbackground-color-wrapper" data-testid="legal-accordion" class="css-1twbjtk e1t2wbv0"><div id="pers-5SJqm2i5hKu0pdrjaIuhxE-legal-accordion-wrapper" class="css-1irt24r e1t2wbv4"><div class="css-1mkrbmo e1t2wbv1"><h2 class="css-acjl8y e1t2wbv5"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" id="pers-5SJqm2i5hKu0pdrjaIuhxEBtn" aria-controls="pers-5SJqm2i5hKu0pdrjaIuhxEBtn" data-cy="accordion-button" data-meta="legal--legalaccordion" data-ana="legal--legalaccordion" aria-label="Legal"><img class="css-0" src="https://www.bmo.com/dam_asset/asset/753262a5-5dd8-445c-971f-18aca1fb2508/chevron-right-16.svg" alt="" loading="eager" data-testid="icon" width="16" height="16"><span>Legal</span></button></h2></div></div><div id="pers-5SJqm2i5hKu0pdrjaIuhxE-content" class="css-1irt24r e1t2wbv4"><div class="css-60pp2u e1t2wbv2"><div data-cy="footnotes" class="css-v0gd1r e1t2wbv3"><span class="css-1x3x2ym e5cyl7f0"><p id="footnote-1"><span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">1.</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">Footnote 1 details</span></span>&nbsp;Participation in <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Flex Rewards is subject to terms and conditions found in <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Flex Rewards Program Rules, available at: <a aria-label="Access B M O Flex Rewards Program Rules, opens in a new tab" data-meta="bmocombmoflexrewardsconsumer--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" data-ana="bmocombmoflexrewardsconsumer--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/main/personal/credit-cards/points-rewards/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">bmo.com/bmoflexrewardsconsumer</a>. The Account must be current and in good standing to accrue and redeem points or cash back, as applicable. While points and cash back don’t expire, if the Account is closed for any reason, the Account will no longer be able to accrue points or cash back.&nbsp; All accrued points or cash back not redeemed will be available for redemption for 90 days as long as the Account is closed in good standing. All cash back is redeemable in the form of a statement credit. The introductory rewards bonus is based on total net qualified purchases made in the first three months of account opening and rewards will be awarded to qualifying Accounts 3 - 4 weeks after the conclusion of the three month period.&nbsp;</p><p id="footnote-2"><span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">2.</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">Footnote 2 details</span></span>&nbsp;Anniversary Bonus is based on net purchases made in the year prior to Anniversary Date. Please see the <a aria-label="B M O Flex Rewards Program Plans (P D F, 260 K B), opens in a new tab" data-meta="program rules--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" data-ana="program rules--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/rewardsconsumerpoints.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">Program Rules</a> for more information about the Anniversary Bonus.&nbsp;</p><p id="footnote-3"><span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">3.</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">Footnote 3 details</span></span> Coverage provided under a group insurance policy issued by New Hampshire Insurance Company, an AIG company. Policy provides secondary coverage only. Coverage for a stolen or damaged eligible cellular wireless telephone is subject to terms, conditions, exclusions, and limits of liability of this benefit. The maximum liability is $400 per claim for <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> Platinum Rewards Credit Card, and $600 per covered card per 12-month period. Each claim is subject to a $50 deductible. Coverage is limited to two (2) claims per covered card per 12-month period. The monthly bill associated with the phone must be paid with the eligible card for coverage to be effective. Refer to the <a aria-label="B M O Mastercard Guide to Benefits (P D F, 498 K B), opens in a new tab" data-meta="mastercard guide to benefits 1--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" data-ana="mastercard guide to benefits 1--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/consumermcgtb.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">Mastercard Guide to Benefits</a> for more information.&nbsp;</p><p id="footnote-4"><span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">4.</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">Footnote 4 details</span></span> Certain terms, conditions, and exclusions apply. Extended Warranty, Master RoadAssist<sup class="css-129gw94 eyqmael1">®</sup> and MasterRental<sup class="css-129gw94 eyqmael1">®</sup> are underwritten by New Hampshire Insurance Company, an AIG company. For complete coverage terms and conditions call 1-800-MASTERCARD (1-800-627-8372) for assistance. Refer to the <a aria-label="Access B M O Mastercard Guide to Benefits (P D F, 498 K B), opens in a new tab" data-meta="mastercard guide to benefits 2--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" data-ana="mastercard guide to benefits 2--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/consumermcgtb.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">Mastercard Guide to Benefits</a>&nbsp;for more information.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p id="footnote-5"><span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">5.</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">Footnote 5 details</span></span>&nbsp;You can request to transfer balances from credit card accounts that you have with other credit card issuers. By submitting your Balance Transfer request you agree that the terms and conditions of your <a aria-label="Access B M O Consumer Cardholder Agreement (P D F, 333 K B), opens in a new tab" data-meta="cardholder agreement--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" data-ana="cardholder agreement--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/ccagreement.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">Cardholder Agreement&nbsp;</a>apply to all balances transferred. Please refer to the <a aria-label="Access B M O Summary of credit terms (P D F, 198 K B), opens in a new tab" data-meta="summary of credit terms 1--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" data-ana="summary of credit terms 1--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/standardcreditcards.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">Summary of Credit Terms</a> for important information about rates and fees.&nbsp;</p><p id="footnote-6"><span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">6.</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">Footnote 6 details</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span><span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span> PaySmart installment plans allow cardholders to repay specific eligible purchases in equal monthly payments over a defined repayment schedule. When you create a PaySmart Plan, it will be subject to a fixed monthly fee of up to 1%. The exact fee will be based on the purchase amount and the duration of the plan, which will be disclosed when the plan is created. The monthly plan fee will remain the same until the PaySmart Plan is paid in full. Review the <a aria-label="Access B M O PaySmart Terms and Conditions (P D F, 173 K B), opens in a new tab" data-meta="terms and conditions--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" data-ana="terms and conditions--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/main/personal/credit-cards/paysmart-terms-conditions.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">Terms and Conditions</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p id="footnote-7"><span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">7.</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">Footnote 7 details</span></span>&nbsp;Certain terms, conditions, and exclusions apply. Call 1-800-Mastercard for assistance. Additional details are provided in the <span><abbr>BMO</abbr></span><span> </span><a aria-label="B M O Mastercard Guide to Benefits (P D F, 498 K B), opens in a new tab" data-meta="mastercard guide to benefits 3--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" data-ana="mastercard guide to benefits 3--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/consumermcgtb.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">Mastercard Guide to Benefits</a>&nbsp;for more information.&nbsp;</p><p id="footnote-8"><span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">8.</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">Footnote 8 details</span></span>&nbsp;Pay only for purchases that you have authorized on your Mastercard card. Unauthorized purchases are not your responsibility. Conditions and exceptions apply. Learn more at <a aria-label="Access Mastercard Zero Liability site, opens an external page in a new tab" data-meta="httpwwwmastercarduszero-liabilityhtml--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" data-ana="httpwwwmastercarduszero-liabilityhtml--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" href="https://www.mastercard.com/us/en/personal/protection-and-security/zero-liability-protection.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">http://www.mastercard.us/zero-liability.html</a>.&nbsp;</p><p id="footnote-9"><span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">9.</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">Footnote 9 details</span></span>​ CreditView and its features, Score Simulator and Credit Education, are provided by TransUnion<sup class="css-129gw94 eyqmael1">®</sup> for educational purposes only. You should consult with your own financial team for more information about credit score.&nbsp;</p><p><span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">*</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">footnote star details</span></span><span> </span><a aria-label="Access the B M O Summary of Credit Terms (P D F, 198 K B), opens in a new tab" data-meta="summary of credit terms 2--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" data-ana="summary of credit terms 2--rte-footnotes-legalaccordion" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/pdf/credit/standardcreditcards.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-rte="true">Summary of Credit Terms</a> for rate and fee information.&nbsp;</p><p>Apple and Apple Pay<sup class="css-129gw94 eyqmael1">®</sup> are trademarks of Apple Inc., registered in the <span><abbr>U.S.</abbr></span> and other countries.&nbsp;</p><p>Google Play and the Google Pay are trademarks of Google LLC.&nbsp;</p><p>Samsung and Samsung Pay are trademarks of Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd. Use only in accordance with law. Other company and product names mentioned may be trademarks or their respective owners.&nbsp;</p><p>Mastercard, the Mastercard Brand Mark, Mastercard<sup class="css-129gw94 eyqmael1">®</sup> ID Theft Protection<span><span aria-hidden="true" class="css-0 enikfnm1">™</span><span class="css-v12mhn enikfnm0">trademark</span></span>, Master RoadAssist<sup class="css-129gw94 eyqmael1">®</sup>, MasterRental<sup class="css-129gw94 eyqmael1">®</sup>,&nbsp;and the circles design are trademarks of Mastercard International Incorporated.</p></span></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer data-section="footer" data-region="footer" role="contentinfo" class="css-0 eak5arf0"><div id="persPreactFooter"><div id="PreactFooterRoot" class="css-3r3dbw"><div data-region="footer section" id="persFooterSection" class="css-cwbmjq"><div class="css-14rmsn5"><div class="css-uv7rmt"><div id="persFooterPrimaryLinks" class="css-d0kl01"><div id="persFooterPrimaryLinksGroup-0" class="css-xxg9v6"><div title="Explore our services" class="css-1y8xhm9"><h2 class="css-15dwd49">Explore our services</h2></div><ul role="list" id="persFooterPrimaryLinksGroupList-0" class="css-f5726c"><li role="listitem"><a aria-label="Explore our bank accounts" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/main/personal/bank-accounts/" target="_self" data-ana="bank accounts--footer primary link" data-meta="bank-accounts--footer-primary-link" font-size="18px" class="css-18j57mx"><div class="css-z2p5yl">Bank Accounts</div></a></li><li role="listitem"><a aria-label="Explore our checking accounts" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/main/personal/bank-accounts/checking-accounts/" target="_self" data-ana="checking accounts--footer primary link" data-meta="checking-accounts--footer-primary-link" font-size="18px" class="css-18j57mx"><div class="css-z2p5yl">Checking Accounts</div></a></li><li role="listitem"><a aria-label="Explore our savings accounts" href="https://www.bmo.com/en-us/main/personal/bank-accounts/savings-and-cds/" target="_self" data-ana="savings accounts--footer primary link" data-meta="savings-a